window.products.push({"id":401140,"name":"Esatto Bar Products Premium Rectangular Bar Caddy (Chrome), Professional Bar Tool Used to Easily Organize Bar Items and Workspace, With 12 Black Plast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vSCiouCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RECTANGULAR ORGANIZATION TOOL - Get your workplace organized by placing items for the preparation of drinks in Esatto's premium square bar caddy. With how hectic bar service can be, the last thing you want is to need something for service and not have it ready. This can add to unnecessary stress. Use this rectangular bar caddy to organize items in your bar. Place items like straws, napkins, stirrers and cocktail picks all in one place for easy access and organization. EFFICIENT DRINK PREPARATION - Similar to a chef in a kitchen, with all ingredients ready and on hand, the whole cooking process goes faster. In the same way, the premium square bar caddy places all the necessary items within arms reach. In this way, bartenders can better get in tune to the service flow. At the same time, without having to think about what they may need, they can prepare drinks at a faster and more efficient pace. More customers can be served and more profit can be made. ADDED POURERS FOR PRECISION POURING - This set also comes with 12 black plastic pourers. Pour with precision and never waste another drop from your bottles. These pourers mean no rust and years of continuous use whether at home or at a bar. While these pourers do not fit bottles with oversized necks, they fit most other bottles utilized at bars. Every drop is an opportunity to earn, and the pourers ensure that this opportunity turns a profit. They can also be used for syrups, juices, and oils. NO LEAKS – Leaks are a sneaky and slow death for many liquids. These include oils, juices, spirits, and even liquor. The thing about leaks is that they go unnoticed until a big portion is already wasted. With Esatto's plastic pourers or liquor spout pourers, these precious liquids will never leak out. The effect is that bartenders and bar owners can utilize every last drop from spirits, with the end goal of being served to customers and turning a tidy profit. PREMIUM PACKAGING - Esatto's premium square bar caddy comes in beautiful premium packaging. Esatto combines design with functionality, ensuring that every item is packed neat and well. The packaging also makes it an ideal bartender gifts for men. Whether you are gifting it to a fellow bartender, or to someone who has a home bar, this will be a useful and welcome addition. It is also a great gift idea for birthdays, weddings, housewarming presents, and many more occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vSCiouCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Esatto","source_asin":"B0BNZD1N7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNZD1N7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNZD1N7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
