window.products.push({"id":401266,"name":"Hooker Furniture Studio Geo Extendable Trestle Dining Table in Light Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+C8oLXI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you noticed that imagination can be more real than reality? You'll want to come sit by us then, just around the corner at Studio 7H. It's imaginary world where very real things happen. Namely, a makeover for a familiar old friend: the furniture collection. Pick the Studio 7H pieces that you love and watch things come together. Great items work the room or go their own way. Just like your best parties. Unplanned, often random, but always perfect. And totally real. Underlying structure is a truly thing of beauty. Here, the geometry of Xs and crossbeams form the table's pedestal base. Company coming? No worries, with two 20-inch leaves, no one's left standing. Hooker Furniture uses carefully chosen solid wood and select wood veneers over durable wood products in our furniture construction. Use of veneers enables more decorative looks unattainable with solid wood. Veneers are used over durable wood products such as medium density fiberboard (MDF) and particle board, made of renewable resources. MDF and particle board are used in quality furniture for areas that need to be stable, such as large surfaces. These durable wood products do not expand and contract with heat and cold and do not absorb moisture as much as solid wood, which results in stronger and longer-lasting furniture. Hooker Furniture utilizes a multiple-step finish process of up to 16 finish steps. This results in an unsurpassed clarity, depth and color richness and durability to our finishes. Through hand-craftsmanship such as rubbing and padding, our finishes feel as good as they look, with a smoothness that is delightful to the touch. Scandinavian: The look is organic and modern -- wood finishes are light and thirsty and we've added natural elements like rope and metal on select pieces. Form and function are important. Pieces can be mulit-purposed. Scandinavian style stands alone or can mix with other personas so easily.Features :- Finish: Light Brown","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+C8oLXI0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hooker Furniture","source_asin":"B00ZH3RKM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZH3RKM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZH3RKM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
