window.products.push({"id":401452,"name":"Kitchen towels matryoshka 100% cotton matryoshka kitchen linen cotton waffle fabric set of 3 pieces matrioshka doll print babushka","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wNNeEI39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"23 x 18 inches. Charming and colorful design featuring a babushka covered Matryoshka, our kitchen towel set lends an eastern European charm to your kitchen. With big blue eyes, pretty red lips, and blond hair, this Matryoshka is eager to help you with your kitchen chores. Each kitchen towel in this 3 piece set displays this lovely matrioshka wearing a different colored babushka. Designs features accents of strawberries, flowers, and ethnic patterns. Brighten up your kitchen with these colorful kitchen towels and make kitchen duties less of a chore. Incredibly absorbent fabric this cotton waffle fabric will amaze you with how quickly and how much liquid it absorbs. Constructed with a special weave, it looks like it's made of tiny rectangles which give it the name \"waffle fabric\". The uniqueness of this weave instills this kitchen towel with virtues that set it apart from other towels. This cotton waffle fabric weave allows the towel to outperform smooth towels in both absorbency and speed of absorption. Capture spills before they spread and with using fewer towels when you use our kitchen towels made of 100% cotton waffle fabric. The design of the waffle weave also allows this kitchen towel to be highly resistant to rips and tears, ensuring that it will last you a long time. It's also incredibly soft and gentle on your hands so you can use it as often as necessary without worrying about irritating your skin. We only have one earth, and we have to protect it every way we can. These kitchen towels help you do just that in two ways. First they're created of sustainably sourced cotton. Secondly, they are reusable. By using them again and again, you can decrease your paper towel use and decrease your carbon foot print. Protect the environment, make kitchen clean up quicker, and add a splash of bright color to your kitchen now add these towels to your shopping cart .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91wNNeEI39L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Matryoshka","source_asin":"B01MSDDP1I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MSDDP1I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MSDDP1I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
