window.products.push({"id":401511,"name":"Wine Tumbler Funny Sayings World’s Best Boss – 12oz Stainless Steel Leak Proof Coffee Mug Wine Tumblers with Lids – Great Gift for Female Co-Worker Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617AB5CGZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Worlds Best Boss Wine Tumbler High quality 18/8 food grade stainless steel 304 inner and outer layers, powder coated for a flawless finish. Doesn't affect the taste of your wine. Unbreakable and sweat-free stainless steel cup. BPA free splash proof lid, easy to clean. Advanced Double-Walled Insulated Technology Double walled insulated provides a sweat proof and condensation free cup exterior, will Keep cold drinks cold and hot ones hot for hours, whenever and wherever. Great for travel and outdoor use.Enjoy our top-quality wine growler setthat designed by top America designer team. Modern Curved Design, Smooth Lips, Easy to Drink Modern curved design that is easy to hold. Includes a removable anti splash lid that works great just sipping or with a straw.Enjoy every sip with vacuum Insulated stainless steel wine tumbler with lid - made to keep your coffee scalding-hot for up to 6 hours & cold drinks ice-cold for up to 12 hours!White, rose, red and black wines - champagne, cocktails, drinks, sparkling water, alcoholic drinks and whiskey.Ideal for RV tours, camping,officeor picnics.12 oz capacity! More wines, more fun.Stylish, elegant and cool design glasses. For any kitchen bench or bar table. Specification Material: food-grade Stainless steel/ ABSwine tumbler holds 12 oz (350 mL)Vacuum insulated to keep your drink hot/coldClear push-on lid with sip-holePerfect for: home, parties, outdoors and office time Bundle Includes: 1 x Wine tumblers with lid Notice 1. Wash these cups or bottle with sponge cloth or sponge ball after dipped into warm water. 2. Please remove the lid first if you are going to wash the cup in dishwasher.3. Please do not use it in microwave oven for heating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617AB5CGZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linquo","source_asin":"B081LZ4XY6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081LZ4XY6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081LZ4XY6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":401512,"name":"Melange Coupe 18-Piece Porcelain Dinnerware Set (Berries Collection) | Service for 6 | Microwave, Dishwasher & Oven Safe | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LGk6ftlpL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye. An Everyday Porcelain Dinner Plate Set Designed to Last and Impress Impress your guests, crown that dinner party, or upgrade your everyday dinnerware with an elegant porcelain coupe dinner set that epitomizes durability. We’ve combined high-quality porcelain with a unique chip-resistant design to create a porcelain set that you can use every single day without dealing with constant cracking, flaking, or chipping.  - Vitrified at temperatures of over 2480F.  - Microwave, oven and dishwasher safe.  - 0% porosity for greater durability.  - Complete set for service of 4 or 8.  - Elegant floral pattern and lovely glaze. Designed to Last We’ve adopted a premium approach to treat you to a dinner plate set that will serve you for years. Not only is the porcelain treated at higher temperatures to make it much stronger but the place sets have special rounded edges that keep chipping at bay, and the high-heat treated porcelain never absorbs any moisture that leads to cracking like others do. For Daily Use No dealing with fragile porcelain dinner sets that you only whip out whenever you have company. Melange dinnerware is strong enough to handle the rigors of daily use. You can safely use it in the microwave, clean it in the dishwasher without breaking, and even use it to reheat food in the oven up to 400F. Everything You Need Every set comes with a dinner plate, salad plate, soup bowl and a mug; everything you need to serve your family or guests a full course meal. Choose between our 16-piece set that comes with 4 of each piece of cutlery and serves 4, or our 32-piece dinner set that comes with 8 of each and serves 8. Understated Elegance Simple yet eye-catching, our range of designs exude an effortless elegance that blends into just about any setting. Beautifully done floral detailing meets lovely colors and a well-done glaze to create porcelain place settings with a premium feel. Get one set for yourself and a couple more as gifts and experience the magic of Melange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LGk6ftlpL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B074XGYRYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074XGYRYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074XGYRYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
