window.products.push({"id":401525,"name":"HOMESTEAD Calico Print Cotton Tablecloth 90\" x 60\" Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Mj2Jbf4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TABLECLOTH-RECTANGLE ~ Gorgeous Calico rectangle tablecloth. Use color code \"B\" for matching linens. Measures approximately 60 x 90 inches. Made of 100% quality cotton. They are color fast and can be machine washed separately on cool/gentle and tumble dried. Lovely geometric border in red, olive and dark coral. Our tablecloths will add a unique quality to your dining experience. Many of our tablecloths have matching placemats and napkins that can be purchased individually. You will love the rich colors and quality of the Calico. Your Calico tablecloth can be used for: FORMAL DINING ~ CASUAL DINING ~ RESTAURANTS ~ SPECIAL OCCASIONS Hard to find table linens for unique minded people~:-)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Mj2Jbf4JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artist Unknown","source_asin":"B00DV3KMOC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DV3KMOC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DV3KMOC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":401526,"name":"O2COOL Mini Misting Fan - Portable Pocket Size Battery Powered Cooling Fan With Carabiner Clip (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BoaEC4sOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"O2COOL’s personal misting fan is a great accessory for on-the-go.  Small, only 3 inches, this personal fan provides both cooling and misting.  It has a powerful one-speed motor with soft foam blades.  Fine mist sprayer keeps you cool on even the hottest of days.  Included carabiner allows you to clip the O2COOL Carabiner Misting Fan to your bag, belt loop or anything that is coming with you on your adventures.  Our Carabiner Misting Fan uses 1-AA Cell battery (not included).  This product is perfect for camping, sports activities and anywhere you need a little cooling and misting. Product Care: For best performance, always use a fresh alkaline battery. For best performance, always use a fresh alkaline battery. There is a risk of leakage from the battery if it is installed incorrectly.  Please follow the instructions. There is a risk of leakage from the battery if it is installed incorrectly.  Please follow the instructions. Remove water when placing in purse or storage Remove water when placing in purse or storage When storing the fan for more than 2 weeks, please remove the battery and ensure fan is in the “off” position. When storing the fan for more than 2 weeks, please remove the battery and ensure fan is in the “off” position. Clean only with a dry cloth.  Do not allow water to drip into the fan. Clean only with a dry cloth.  Do not allow water to drip into the fan. For 25 years, O2COOL has been a leading designer, manufacturer and distributor of creative consumer products that solve unique problems.  Our products are innovative, multi-functional and cool by design.  Founded in 1992, we are a market leader in the portable cooling and hydration industries.  Our patent protected products make every day unique.  In 2015, we expanded into the Pool, Patio & Beach as well as Pet categories for the active consumer.  In 2017, we acquired bobble, a high-quality, high-design lineup of hydration and filtration products with strong intellectual property and Zing Anything, an infusion hydration and housewares product line, to our family of products solidifying our commitment to the active lifestyle consumer.  Cool by Design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BoaEC4sOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O2COOL","source_asin":"B07D1HK3S6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D1HK3S6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D1HK3S6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":401527,"name":"TIONLCLC Can Opener, Can Opener, 2022 Upgrade Version Can Opener, Multi-Purpose, Reusable Steel Can Opener, Gifts For Kitchen And Camping (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A7brOpN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧈[Smooth Like a Hot Knife Through Butter] Our can opener is made of zinc alloy, with a one-piece molding process. It doesn't easily bend or break, and will not rust over time. The blade is made of a sturdy, high-hardness alloy (high-carbon stainless steel), which is harder and sharper, and it can easily pierce all types of cans. Its plated cutting-side discs cut smoothly through metal lids like a hot knife through butter, not creating metal chips or jagged marks on the inside of the can. 🥫[The Magic Kitchen Gadget] Unlike other electric can openers, our manual can opener does not require power and is portable. It is suitable for all types of canned food (e.g., fish, milk powder, pet food, etc.). The whole body is made of imported Indian dyes after 12 washing processes and electrophoresis coloring to ensure safer contact with food. It has been tested and can be used thousands of times! We have also attached the usage video at the end for your reference. 👵[Friendly for Arthritis Patients and the Elderly] Our handheld can opener is the highest-quality and most reliable can opener on the market. It has an ergonomic handle for a firmer grip and reduces stress on your hands when using it, thereby making it the perfect gift for arthritis sufferers or elderly people. After use, it can be rinsed directly with tap water or put into the dishwasher. Then the crank can be folded down for storage. 🎁[Versatile, Holiday Gift] It's the right size for easy travel, parties, and camping, and it's the most useful kitchen gadget you’ll ever own! It's elegantly styled and designed for home kitchens, bakeries, restaurants, and bars. It's suitable for business, dinners, picnics, weddings, and birthdays. It can be considered the perfect gift for family, friends—or even chefs! Whether it's New Year's Day, Valentine's Day, Easter, Halloween, Thanksgiving, or Christmas, it can be given as a perfect gift! 🇺🇸[Lifetime Warranty Service] To make your purchase risk-free, we will be happy to provide you with a professional warranty and replacement service. If there is any problem with the product, then you can always contact us online, and we will do everything possible to solve your problem. Your satisfaction is our eternal purpose.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A7brOpN+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TIONLCLC","source_asin":"B0B86FXRJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401527","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B86FXRJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B86FXRJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
