window.products.push({"id":401554,"name":"Large Waterproof Bathroom Wall Clock, Big Water Resistant Hanging Shower Clock for Bath Countertop, Moisture Proof Temperature Humidity Meter, Suction","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rUGRZm43L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Waterproof for water splashes,ideal water resist large clock, perfect for use on bathroom mirror or shower room mirrors and kitchen.the display is very large and easy to see,so it is easy to keep track of time and to save water while taking shower. the four suction cups on the back keep the clock suck on mirror or the smooth bathroom wall very well (make sure to clean and moisten the both of the surface and the suction cups before putting it up) It is not only a clock,but also a thermometer, hygrometer, which monitor the indoor humidity and temperature. celsius and fahrenheit (c/f) switchable, range 0°c ~ 50°c (0°f ~ 122°f). it is sealed up well enough to handle bathroom environment, as always, the clock can provide accurate temperature, humidity and time under wet or other harsh conditions. Time in 12/24 hour mode optional. big time display for easy reading in your bathroom or hall even from a distance with its big bold numbers. the numbers are large and can be viewed from various angles around the room.simply powered by 1*aa battery (not included) [Dimension: 6.6\"L x 2.36 \" W x 6.6 \" H] Best large clock gift for your parents. this digital shower clock with thermo-hygrometer is modern and beautiful, easily attached on mirror with magnet suction cups. packed in a beautiful box, ideal for birthdays gifts, also it is suitable for decoration for home,hotel,elderly or children’s room. [Buy with Confidence, 365 Days Replacement Free] Flexible placement by 3 mounting options. the shower clock can stand on a table, bathroom vanity, kitchen table, office desk, or shelf desk by pulling out the table stand brackets from behind the clock. also it supports hanging on the wall by using the hanging hole. as the greatest feature,you can suction it on smooth vertical surface with four strong suction cups , like glass, window, mirror, tiles, stainless steel and any non-porous surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rUGRZm43L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"homemelinda","source_asin":"B0716ZTNR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0716ZTNR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0716ZTNR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":401555,"name":"NOVICA Multicolor Archaeological Ceramic Sculpture, 10\" Tall, Huitzilopochtli'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i9gBX8ESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA works together with talented artists, artisans, and designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake handmade treasures. Our mantra is to Spread Happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer!About this item: Huitzilopochtli, the Aztec god of sun and war, appears in colorful regalia in this ceramic sculpture by Angel Cerón. He is inspired by the images of the legendary deity featured in the Mexica Codex, for the original sculpture was said to have been destroyed by a Spanish soldier and was rescued by a Tlatolatl. The statue reappeared in 1530 during an investigation by Bishop Zumárraga, only to be lost again. It is speculated to be safely hidden in a cave somewhere in the Anahuac Valley. Huitzilopochtli was represented as a hummingbird as it was believed that great warriors are reborn as these birds. Huitzilopochtli is usually depicted with a feathered headdress, a black face, and a scepter shaped like a snake. Ceron sculpts the piece with yellow clay and uses natural dyes for color.All natural dyesSigned by the artistAbout our Artist: Angel Ceron comes from a family with generations of artisan experience. He learned the family ceramic techniques from his father, Antonio Ceron Orta, a renowned artisan. Angel began a long study of Mexico's pre-Hispanic cultures and learned the Nahuatl language spoken in ancient Mesoamerica. He uses clay from northern Oaxaca state, the only clay of this kind in Mexico and perhaps in the world. The unique characteristics of this yellow clay make it ideal for his work....","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i9gBX8ESL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01J293Q46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J293Q46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J293Q46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
