window.products.push({"id":401616,"name":"Alpaca Knits Handmade Alpaca Wool Blanket (Peppered)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QROlPq9cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alpacas have been bred in Pre-Columbian, South America for over 5,000 years. Domesticated from the Vicunas by the ancient tribes of the Andean highlands of Ecuador, Peru, Chile, Bolivia and Northwest of Argentina. Two-thousand-years-old paraca textiles are thought to include alpaca fiber. Also known as \"The Fiber of the gods\", Alpaca was used to make clothing for royalty. Alpaca fleece is the natural fiber harvested from an alpaca. It is a soft, durable, luxurious and silky natural fiber. Alpaca fleece is as soft as cashmere, warmer than sheep's wool, hypo-allergenic and almost completely waterproof. In a world growing weary of synthetic materials and in need of eco-friendly choices, alpaca fiber offers an opportunity for consumers to use soft, warm, durable, and natural garments. Our exquisitely created blankets in Ecuador are finished by hand by local artisans, a process that has been handed down from generation to generation! Use the blanket to decorate your bed, sofa, or just snuggle with a glass of wine watching your favorite show. Whatever your choice of colors, you’ll be surely amazed by it’s softness, lightness, warmth, brilliant color, and never ending compliments from your friends and family. To wash your alpaca fur, throw it in the washer and set it on delicate, or wash by hand. Please use cold water, and NEVER dry it in a dryer. After natural drying, use an iron and a soft brush and brush the blanket in ONE direction only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QROlPq9cS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpaca Knits","source_asin":"B0916SR2R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0916SR2R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0916SR2R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
