window.products.push({"id":401623,"name":"Amazon Brand – Pinzon Lightweight Cotton Flannel Duvet Cover - King, Snowflake Bordeaux","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UsQDak27L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description A winter look is given to your bedding, by a stylish Snowflakes pattern design. An Amazon Brand. Amazon.com 160-gram cotton flannel duvet cover with cheerful snowflake print. view larger Printed Cotton Flannel Duvet Cover What You Need to Know: Made of 100% cotton 160-gram flannel Made of 100% cotton 160-gram flannel Hidden button closure Hidden button closure Available in Twin, Full/Queen, and King Available in Twin, Full/Queen, and King Variety of colors and styles available Variety of colors and styles available Coordinates with Pinzon 160-gram solid flannel sheets and shams (sold separately) Coordinates with Pinzon 160-gram solid flannel sheets and shams (sold separately) Made in Portugal; machine washable Made in Portugal; machine washable Pinzon 160-Gram Printed Cotton Flannel Duvet Cover Give your bedroom the designer look it deserves with this cotton flannel duvet cover by Pinzon. The printed cover fits over any existing duvet of the same size, securing with a hidden button closure. It's available in Twin, Full/Queen, and King sizes. Go from boring to brilliant in seconds. Cheerful Snowflake Print The duvet cover features a solid color in a choice of either Gray or Bordeaux that functions as the background to its white snowflake motif. Large intricately designed snowflakes repeat in bands between rows of more petite snowflake replicas. Ideal for kids rooms, master bedrooms, and guest rooms alike, the duvet cover makes a festive and cozy choice during those long, dark winter months. 100% Cotton Flannel In addition to its fun snowflake design, the duvet cover provides exceptional softness. Woven from 100-percent cotton, the comfortable fabric has a flannel weight of 160 grams per square meter, which equals coziness you'll want to curl up with. Coordinates Beautifully The duvet cover works well with existing bedding and coordinates beautifully with Pinzon's matching 160-gram solid flannel sheets and shams (sold separately). Machine Washable Made in Portugal, the imported 160-gram printed cotton flannel duvet cover is machine-washable and can go in the dryer for easy care. Pinzon Bedding A few simple upgrades in the bedroom can create the welcome effect of a new beginning--whether it's January 1st or a Sunday. Such a simple pleasure, really--fresh, clean sheets, fluffy pillows, and cozy comforters. You can feel like a five-star guest in your own home with bed linens by Pinzon. Fold back the covers, slip into sweet happy dreams, and wake up refreshed. It's a brand-new day. For the master bedroom or a charming guest room, the Pinzon brand provides the high-quality bedding needed for a restful night of sleep. The Pinzon brand includes everything from memory foam mattress pads, mattress and pillow protectors, sheets, and duvet sets to luxurious Permaloft pillows, which you can never have enough of--especially when enjoying breakfast in bed (sometimes you just have to indulge). About Pinzon Invite Amazon.com's Pinzon products into your home for their form and function, and experience their style, craftsmanship, and value. We travel the world to find the best materials and designs for Pinzon products and use the most sensible manufacturing methods. We thoroughly test each Pinzon item and rely on feedback from our customers to help us deliver the highest quality. Check out all of our Pinzon products, including bedding, towels, and more, and you'll find something for all occasions at the best values. With a selection that continues to grow, the Pinzon brand is set to become a part of your lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UsQDak27L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pinzon","source_asin":"B00CL55KHU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CL55KHU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CL55KHU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
