window.products.push({"id":401803,"name":"Home-X Small Stacking Shelf, Stackable Kitchen Storage, Cabinet Counter Desk Organizer, 10” L x 10” W x 6.5” H - White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iouSaW+yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Staying organized at home doesn't have to be difficult with our Small Stacking Shelf. This freestanding shelf is a great way to take advantage of vertical space in cabinets or closets. This shelf is made with durable PP plastic and doesn't require any hardware to put together. With your purchase, you will get a shelf and 4 legs. The legs fit into slots in the corners on the underside of the shelf. To assemble, simply slide the legs through the slots and that's it! No tools or screws needed. Once the shelf is assembled, you can place it anywhere in your home. You can also stack another shelf on top of this one to create a tiered storage system. The shelf measures 10\" L x 10\" W x 6 1/2\" H. It can be used to store a variety of items, including plates, cups, bowls, pans, food containers, measuring cups, spices, small tools, and other supplies. Use the organizer wherever you want to utilize space more efficiently. Because the shelving unit is made of plastic, it's easy to clean. Just use soapy water or your favorite multipurpose cleaner. The small grid pattern on the shelf also allows dirt, liquid, and other particles to fall through while keeping your items secure. Plus, the holes help maintain air flow. These organizing shelves make great gifts for friends or loved ones because they are versatile and easy to use. Give these risers as a functional gift for weddings, birthdays, housewarming parties, and other special occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iouSaW+yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08F39GZCD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F39GZCD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F39GZCD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
