window.products.push({"id":401819,"name":"Hoomall Set of 4 Stripe Grey Pillow Covers Pattern Sofa Cushion Case Throw Pillow Cover 18x18 inches Without Core (Ordinary, Stripe Grey-4PCS)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tK2tKvoML._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Includes: 18\" x 18\" unique design of love themed pillow covers; they contain no filling inside and very suitable for your home decor on Spring/Summer/Fall/Winter Cushion cover ONLY (NO Insert) No Filler , Pattern just on ONE side Material:high quality cotton linen, soft burlap;There may be some different in the object and the picture. Please note: the pattern is printed on the front. The other side is natural tan color as this is a linen product! 100% handmade and made of hight quality material and fabric--50% Cotton + 50% Linen.Makes the perfect accent on a couch, sofa, chair, window seat or bed. It also makes a perfect housewarming or birthday gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tK2tKvoML._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoomall","source_asin":"B07WG532N2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WG532N2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WG532N2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":401820,"name":"Island Bamboo 4-Piece Pakkawood Utensils Set – Durable, Eco-Friendly – Includes: (1) Traditional Spoon, (1) 3-Slotted Spoon, (1) Angled Corner Spoon, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NNkF8dKRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Save Your Cookware - Unlike many metal or plastic cooking spoon sets, Island Bamboo Pakkawood will not leave scratches on your pots and pans. They're also nonstick and don't require tons of scrubbing and soaking to clean. Pakkawood is heat resistant and won't melt into your food like plastics (yikes!), keeping you safe from harmful chemicals and toxins. Spice Up Your Kitchen - Pakkawood is crafted from many layers of beautiful hardwoods, and infused with natural and chemical-free dyes. The final result is a colorful piece of functional art, with no two utensils looking the same. Toss your drab black plastic spoons out and opt for the exotic! Due to the handmade nature of our products, there may be slight variations in color and/or craftsmanship. 4-Piece Set - Spoon, Slotted Spoon, Corner Spoon, & Spatula - This 4-piece set includes everything you'll need for cooking all types of meals. The 12\" Spoon & Slotted Spoon are great for stirring, serving, and draining soups and pastas. The 12\" Corner spoon is perfect for scraping hard-to-reach areas in your pots or baking dishes. The 12\" Straight-Edge Spatula works well for sautéing, flipping, and serving. Protect the Planet - We all know that plastics are bad for the environment and are harming the earth, but what are we doing to stop it? Do your part and invest in chemical-free cooking utensils. You'll not only be making a healthier choice for the planet, you'll also be making a healthier choice for you. Make Clean-Up Easy - These non-stick utensils are quick and easy to clean and take the hassle out of kitchen clean-up. For best results, hand wash with warm soapy water and towel dry. As a precaution, we do not recommend soaking for long periods of time, as this can eventually damage the wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NNkF8dKRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Island Bamboo","source_asin":"B0828BT1TC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0828BT1TC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0828BT1TC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":401821,"name":"ONVO goods Bridal Shower & Bachelorette Party Decorations: Ring Foil Balloon, Bride Foil Balloon, 8 Latex Balloons, Metallic Silver Gold Foil Fringe C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sDFgwyJIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We, as a small family business at ONVOgoods, hope to accommodate you on your special day. Whether it is a bridal shower, and engagement party, or a bachelorette party, our hope is that this bachelorette party balloons and decorations kit can make your day even more special. We know how much this day means to you, so we created the perfect bachelorette party decorations kit just for you. We specifically created this set to include a photo backdrop to include a bridal sash, bachelorette photo backdrop, and table decorations. Once the bachelorette party decorations are set up, the entire location will glow in gold and white. YOUR BACHELORETTE PARTY SUPPLIES SET INCLUDES: 1 Bridal Sash with Bride-to-be foil printing (63.0 x 3.8 in) 1 BRIDE foil balloons (16.0 inches tall each separate letter) 1 Gold foil fringe curtain (3.0 x 6.0 ft) 8 Gold latex balloons (standard size) 4 White latex balloons (standard size) 1 Engagement ring foil balloon (20.0 x 28.0 in) 1 Bag of confetti glitter rings (each confetti piece is about 1.2 x 0.8 in) 1 (10pc) set of drinking gold straws ( 6.0 in tall) DIRECTIONS: Simple set up is required with your new bachelorette party decorations set. The bachelorette BALLOONS ARE NOT BLOWN UP and our recommendation is that you take the bridal balloons to your local grocery store or party store and get the balloons blown up. This set also includes a gold foil fringe curtain that can be hung up as a backdrop to take pictures in front of, or to serve as a background to a special table set up. The curtain will need to be hung up with tape or an adhesive of your choice. The ring confetti can be used put on tables as a decoration. The bridal sash is to be worn by the bride. The gold straws are to be used to decorate drinks or for drinking through them. We hope we can accommodate to your special day and make it ever-so-beautiful with this gold bridal shower set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91sDFgwyJIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONVO goods","source_asin":"B07BHBBCVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BHBBCVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BHBBCVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
