window.products.push({"id":401888,"name":"Wooden Pepper Mill Grinder, Salt and Pepper Grinder, Best Pepper Grinder Wood with a Adjustable Ceramic Rotor and Easily Refillable - 5 in","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IhVuG6z2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Time to say goodbye to your old salt and pepper mill set! Beautiful wooden style Pepper Mill, it is both your best companion for cooking and nice decoration on your table! Why not bring it how now? Please press \" Add To Cart \" button right now! Adjustable rotor, easy to use. Natural wood makes these grinders a beautiful addition to the table. To adjust the grinding to be fine or coarse, simply twist the rotary knob on the top of the grinder. Perfectly for grinding various spices. Use them to grind peppercorn, sea salt, himalayan salt or any time of fresh spices and enjoy a delicious meal. How to use: Step 1: Turn on the top nut, take away the cover of the top. Step 2: Put the sea salt, Himalayan salt, kosher salt, peppercorn, red pepper, black pepper in the body of mill. Step 3: Replace the cover and twist back the nut, than rotating the top cover, turn the nut clockwise for a fine grind, the counterclockwise for coarse grind, the power will be out from the bottom of the mill. Packing Details: 1 x Pepper Grinder Notes: Due to nature wood material, light and monitors effect, color difference may exist. Hope you can understand it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IhVuG6z2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"champions","source_asin":"B08ZY75HQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZY75HQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZY75HQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
