window.products.push({"id":401964,"name":"Candle Warmer Lamp with 2 Bulbs, Fathers Day Gifts Wax Warmer Lamp with Timer 2H/ 4H/ 8H & Dimmable 4 Brightness, Aromatic Candle Holders for Home Dec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610JZT0TXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Timer 2H/ 4H/ 8H】Our candle warmer lamp can be turned off by timing control 2H/ 4H/ 8H, you don't have to worry about forgetting the heating time while enjoying the fragrance, you can sleep and play with peace of mind anytime. Our candle warmer lamp has a stable base and comes with 2 additional GU10 halogen lamps, ready to use when it arrives. The cord is 5ft long and the shade is 6.29 inches from the base to fit all sizes of Yan kee, Large & Small Jar Candles. 【Dimmer 4 Level Brightness】Our candle melting lamp can be dimmer 4 level of brightness from 0-100 by push button controller, 2900K color temperature, and the wax melting lamp can also adjust the brightness of the light to control the speed of the smell. The higher brightness you push the faster melting speed, scented the fastest and strongest fragrance. 【Safety Use】Using wax melting lamps can keep the candle jar always flat and beautiful, solve the problem of caves without worrying about wax pits, prolong the candle use life and avoiding safety hazards caused by candle burning. Candle wax warmer lamp especially suitable for children's families, pet families, no smoke or no open flame apartments and offices use. 【Stylish Home Decor & Gift】Our melting wax lamp has a beautiful, stylish and simple look, can be placed at bedrooms, living rooms, coffee tables, lounges, beauty rooms, garages, yoga rooms, kitchens, etc. Combine use with scented candles can create a relaxing and warm atmosphere, easily remove unpleasant smells such as pet urine and kitchen waste, and refresh the space. An excellent decoration choice for personal use and gift giving. 【500 Days Unconditional After-Sales】If you have any questions about candle size, brightness dimmer and timer setting, please feel free to contact customer service at any time, and we will provide 500 days unconditional after-sales and Q&A services. welcome any inquiries and suggestions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610JZT0TXgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TigQiang","source_asin":"B0C6QKZM7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-401964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6QKZM7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6QKZM7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
